The TypeScript request header/payload layout, cookie rotation, upload,
conversation and media protocol adapters are derived from that project's
protocol implementation. This rewrite does not distribute its Go binaries,
Chrome TLS fingerprinting stack, or an external proxy implementation.

Repository history before this rewrite is retained on the original main
branch and in git history. Historical upstream attribution remains there.
